# For the Rust images (services/Dockerfile, built from the repository root).
# The dashboard's build context is web/dashboard, which has its own.
#
# Only the Cargo workspace goes in, so nothing else at the root (the dashboard,
# Connect, a local node_modules) reaches the build or invalidates its cache.
*
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!crates/
!services/

# Local settings.
**/config.toml
**/.env*

# Not needed to build. changed-images.mjs leaves tests and Markdown out too
# when it decides which images to rebuild.
**/tests/
**/*.md
**/target/
services/Dockerfile
